      "uniformFloors": true,
      "description": "32 objectives chosen to span all six domains. Floor applies only to these. The subset composition is forced, not chosen: a 60-question exam draws 60 from a 60-question bank, so each domain's bank allocation must equal its draw quota exactly. Choosing NF 7 / NA 6 / IPC 8 / IPS 3 / SEC 5 / AUTO 3 is the only split where the allocation formula lands on 12/12/15/6/9/6."
